    "Can I take any medicine on my own?",
  ],
  worry: [
    "Do I need to go to a hospital right now?",
    "What symptoms should I watch out for?",
    "Is this related to something I already have?",
  ],
  doctor: [
    "What will the doctor likely ask me?",
